[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0010","text":"嗯～～！\n好舒服～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0020","text":"确实有种被治愈的感觉呢\n这也是大自然的力量？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0030","text":"说不定只是被气氛带动了吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0040","text":"不过，这里确实让人安心呢\n听着大自然的声音就会感到幸福啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0050","text":"嘛，也许吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0060","text":"会是谁的呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0070","text":"两个声音……\n重叠在一起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0080","text":"第三个声音也……\n加入了进来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0090","text":"在宽大的……\n屋檐下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_04_0100","text":"好耀眼……"}]
